### ===== USER PROFILE PUBLIC TESTS =====
### Exécute dans l'ordre, un clic ▶ à la fois

### ===== LOGINS =====

### Login testuser01
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "testuser01",
  "password": "Test1234!@#$"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token1", response.body.access_token);
%}

### Login testuser02
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "testuser02",
  "password": "Test1234!@#$"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token2", response.body.access_token);
%}


### ===== RÉCUPÉRER LES IDS =====

### Get id de testuser01
GET http://localhost:3000/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token1}}

> {%
    client.global.set("id1", response.body.id);
%}

### Get id de testuser02
GET http://localhost:3000/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token2}}

> {%
    client.global.set("id2", response.body.id);
%}


### ===== SETUP PROFIL =====

### User01 met bio en private et musicpreferences en friends-only
PATCH http://localhost:3000/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "visibilitySettings": {
    "bio": "private",
    "musicPreferences": "friends-only"
  }
}

### User01 ajoute une bio et des préférences musicales
PATCH http://localhost:3000/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bio": "Hello je suis testuser01",
  "musicpreferences": ["rap", "rock"]
}


### ===== TEST VISIBILITÉ SANS AMITIÉ =====

### User02 voit le profil de User01 (pas amis)
### -> bio=null (private), musicpreferences=null (friends-only)
GET http://localhost:3000/users/{{id1}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token2}}


### ===== VÉRIFIER SON PROPRE PROFIL =====

### User01 voit son propre profil via /me -> tout visible
GET http://localhost:3000/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token1}}


### ===== DEVENIR AMIS =====

### User01 envoie une demande à User02
POST http://localhost:3000/friendship/request/{{id2}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token1}}

> {%
    client.global.set("friendshipId", response.body.id);
%}

### User02 accepte la demande
PATCH http://localhost:3000/friendship/{{friendshipId}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{token2}}


### ===== TEST VISIBILITÉ AVEC AMITIÉ =====

### User02 voit le profil de User01 (amis maintenant)
### -> bio=null (toujours private), musicpreferences visible (friends-only + amis)
GET http://localhost:3000/users/{{id1}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token2}}


### ===== SÉCURITÉ =====

### Sans token -> should 401
GET http://localhost:3000/users/{{id1}}

### User inexistant -> should 404
GET http://localhost:3000/users/99999
Authorization: Bearer {{token1}}